              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "deebee0611"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I was skeptical about making this over a traditional banana bread but I’m so glad I did! I used 1 cup all purpose flour and 1 and a half cups whole wheat and about 3/4 of the sugar it called for and it still turned out great! Will definitely make again!",
            "datePublished": "2019-09-18T19:09:35.560Z"
          },
          {
