            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Sandra H"
            },
            "reviewBody": "We thoroughly enjoyed this variation on a traditional banana bread. I used butter and regular sour cream instead of margarine and low fat sour cream, otherwise stuck exactly to the recipe. For my oven, even at 350, I did bake the loaves for an additional 10 minutes for the toothpick to come out clean. Enjoy!",
