              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Blue Jay"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Loved this bread, it turned out great! Definitely did not seem too chocolatey to me. I made the following changes for a little added nutrition: 1 cup quick cooking oats and 2 cups of flour. 1/2 cup applesauce and 1/2 cup shortening. Used 3/4 cup brown sugar, and 3/4 cup of white sugar.? Also added 1 cup chopped walnuts. Baked in a Bundt cake pan and loved the outcome!",
            "datePublished": "2020-10-08T20:11:06.307Z"
