              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "peppini"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was good. It needs about 3/4 tsp. of salt to counter all of that sweet. It needs more chocolate flavor as well, for my taste. So I also upped the cocoa by 1/4 cup the second time I made it. These changes made the recipe much better to me. Four stars after the changes. Thank you for posting the recipe!",
